### ⚠️ Requires [Provi's Origins](https://github.com/Provismet/Provi-Origins/wiki) to be installed! ⚠️

## Act On Owner

---

[Entity Action Type](https://github.com/Provismet/Provi-Origins/wiki/Act-On-Owner)

Performs a bientity action on the owner of this tamed entity. The tamed entity is the __actor__ and the owner is the __target__.

Type ID: `proviorigins:owner_bientity`

## Fields

---

## Examples
```json
"entity_action": {
    "type": "origins:self_action_on_kill",
    "entity_action": {
        "type": "proviorigins:owner_bientity",
        "bientity_action": {
            "type": "origins:target_action",
            "action": {
                "type": "origins:heal",
                "amount": 2
            }
        }
    }
}
```
This power heals the owner of a tamed entity when that entity kills another.

